cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use RegCheck, please cite the paper below
  (GitHub's "Cite this repository" button gives it in APA and BibTeX).
title: RegCheck
abstract: >-
  An LLM-assisted tool for structured comparisons between study registrations
  (preregistrations, clinical trial registrations, preclinical registrations)
  and the papers that report them.
type: software
authors:
